   "text": "Overseas on a great tour"
  },
  {
   "end": 60.03,
   "start": 58,
   "text": "Or maybe I'm just dreaming."
  },
  {
   "end": 62.17,
   "start": 60.03,
   "text": "It beats being with demons"
  },
  {
   "end": 63.24,
   "start": 62.17,
   "text": "or niggas that's scheming."
  },
  {
   "end": 65.08,
   "start": 63.24,
   "text": "At least I'm thinking of an achievement"
  },
  {
   "end": 67.98,
